    }
  ],
  "translation": "Masakɛ (masakɛ) ka sɛbɛbagaw welera kalo fɔlɔ la, o kalo tile tan-ni-saba don; a sɛbɛnna i n'a fɔ Haman (Haman) y'a min da: masakɛ (masakɛ) ka jamana-ɲɛmɔgɔbaw ma, ani jamana kɔkanna-ɲɛmɔgɔw minnu bɛ jamana kelen-kelen bɛɛ kan, ani jama kelen-kelen bɛɛ ka ɲɛmɔgɔw ma — jamana kelen-kelen bɛɛ, a ka sɛbɛnni cogo la; jama kelen-kelen bɛɛ, a ka kan na. A sɛbɛnna masakɛ Axashwerosh (Ahasuerusi) tɔgɔ ye, ka sigi ni masakɛ ka taamasiyɛnzɛn ye.",
